<h2>The Verdict: How Effective Is an Under the Desk Elliptical?</h2>
<p>By the numbers, an under the desk elliptical is a light-intensity activity that doubles your energy use over sitting at a brisk pace and matches a slow walk. It is not as effective per minute as walking or a gym elliptical. Where it wins is volume: hours of extra movement you would never otherwise get.</p>
<p>If you want to know whether those minutes count as real exercise under health guidelines, read <a href="/is-an-under-desk-elliptical-good-exercise/">is an under desk elliptical good exercise</a>. For the broader research picture, see <a href="/does-an-under-desk-elliptical-work/">does an under desk elliptical work</a>. Ready to start? The [[amazon:cubii-jr2|Cubii JR2]] remains our best all-round pick.</p>
